      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 11,
      "title": {
        "en": "Mixed reception from store and salon staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Customer reviews reflect varying experiences with the store team. Many visitors speak warmly of attentive cashiers, polite floor associates who assist with fish selection, and diligent dog trainers. However, other shoppers report unfriendly and sarcastic service at the cash registers, alongside complaints regarding salon groomers who failed to follow client instructions."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 9,
      "title": {
        "en": "Spacious store and pet-friendly environment"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners value the broad selection of pet food, dog toys, and wellness supplements available at the Park Central branch. Customers frequently mention bringing their leashed dogs inside the shop to browse treats and supplies together. The only notable concern raised in the retail section involves occasional stock shortages and neglected feeder insects."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 5,
      "title": {
        "en": "In-store pets and reptile care concerns"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers highlight welcoming animal-friendly policies, including on-site cat adoption viewing and positive observations of supervised dog training sessions. Visitors enjoy bringing family pets along for shopping trips. However, one customer noted disappointing conditions in the terrarium section, observing poor care and dead feeder insects in retail enclosures."
      }
    }
  ],
